cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenCell Design"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python library providing a hierarchical, composable API for
  building virtual battery cells from individual components and materials.
  OpenCell Design implements a modeling hierarchy that mirrors the physical
  construction of a cell — spanning materials, formulations, electrodes,
  layups, electrode assemblies, encapsulations, and complete cells — and
  calculates mass and cost at every level, enabling direct assessment of
  economic viability alongside electrochemical performance.
